{"title":"Career Roadmap · Research Associate","role":"Research Associate","summary":"A Research Associate conducts structured research, analyses data, evaluates evidence and converts findings into reports, presentations, models and recommendations.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Applied Economics / Financial Economics"},"about":[{"label":"Degree Alignment","text":"Excellent"},{"label":"Primary Sectors","text":"Economics, Finance, Policy, Consulting, Market Research, Think Tanks, Banking, Investment Research"},{"label":"Typical Entry Roles","text":"Research Assistant, Research Associate, Economic Research Associate, Financial Research Associate, Market Research Analyst"},{"label":"Long-Term Roles","text":"Senior Research Associate → Research Analyst → Economist/Research Lead → Research Director"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Research Associate conducts structured research, analyses data, evaluates evidence and converts findings into reports, presentations, models and recommendations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BA specialising in Applied Economics / Financial Economics, this is a particularly strong career path because the degree can provide foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Financial economics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Quantitative methods"},{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The most employable graduates combine economics with statistics + programming + data analysis + financial modelling + professional research writing."},{"type":"note","label":"Important positioning","text":"“Research Associate” is a broad job title. A BA graduate can enter many research roles, but advanced economist, quantitative research and academic research positions often prefer a master's degree or stronger quantitative qualifications."}]},{"heading":"What Does a Research Associate Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The exact work depends on the organisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Economic research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analyse economic indicators"},{"text":"Study inflation, employment and growth"},{"text":"Research industries and markets"},{"text":"Build economic models"},{"text":"Conduct statistical analysis"},{"text":"Prepare economic reports"},{"text":"Monitor policy developments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analyse companies"},{"text":"Study financial statements"},{"text":"Research industries"},{"text":"Track markets"},{"text":"Build financial models"},{"text":"Perform valuation analysis"},{"text":"Monitor investment themes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Policy research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Evaluate government policies"},{"text":"Conduct socioeconomic research"},{"text":"Analyse public programmes"},{"text":"Prepare policy briefs"},{"text":"Conduct impact studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Market research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conduct surveys"},{"text":"Analyse consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Study competitors"},{"text":"Estimate market size"},{"text":"Identify market trends"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"During BA"},{"text":"Research Intern, Economics Intern, Data Research Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Research Assistant, Junior Research Associate, Research Associate"}],[{"text":"1–4 years"},{"text":"Economic Research Analyst, Financial Research Analyst, Market Research Analyst, Policy Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Senior Research Associate, Senior Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Research Lead, Economist, Senior Economist, Investment Research Lead"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Research Director, Chief Economist, Head of Research"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The title Research Associate can therefore be both an entry-level and intermediate position depending on the employer."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Economics + Quantitative Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Mathematics for economics"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial-market basics"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research habits"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Read economic reports"},{"text":"Find reliable datasets"},{"text":"Interpret charts"},{"text":"Identify correlation vs causation"},{"text":"Write concise research summaries"},{"text":"Cite sources properly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"First project"},{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Inflation Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse inflation over several years."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inflation trend"},{"text":"Food vs non-food inflation"},{"text":"Urban vs rural differences where data permits"},{"text":"Possible causes"},{"text":"Policy implications"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Short research conclusion"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Statistics, Econometrics & Data","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is the most important development stage for becoming an analytical research candidate."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean, median, variance"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Statistical significance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn econometrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Simple linear regression"},{"text":"Multiple regression"},{"text":"OLS"},{"text":"Dummy variables"},{"text":"Heteroskedasticity"},{"text":"Multicollinearity"},{"text":"Time-series basics"},{"text":"Panel-data concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"seaborn"},{"text":"statsmodels"},{"text":"SciPy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"R"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"tidyverse"},{"text":"ggplot2"},{"text":"basic econometrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You don't need to master every language. Python + SQL + either R or strong Excel is a very practical combination."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Choose Your Research Track","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By Year 3, choose one major direction."},{"type":"h","text":"Track A — Economic Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Monetary economics"},{"text":"Labour economics"},{"text":"Development economics"},{"text":"International economics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Economic forecasting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible employers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Economic research organisations"},{"text":"Government-linked institutions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track B — Financial Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Equity markets"},{"text":"Fixed income"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Portfolio concepts"},{"text":"Industry analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3-statement modelling"},{"text":"DCF"},{"text":"Comparable-company analysis"},{"text":"Ratio analysis"},{"text":"Financial forecasting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity Research Associate"},{"text":"Financial Research Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Research Analyst"},{"text":"Credit Research Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track C — Policy Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Development economics"},{"text":"Social policy"},{"text":"Public finance"},{"text":"Impact evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy evaluation"},{"text":"Cost-benefit analysis"},{"text":"Programme evaluation"},{"text":"Survey research"},{"text":"Impact assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible employers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Policy organisations"},{"text":"Development institutions"},{"text":"Research centres"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track D — Market Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Pricing research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Consumer analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Build a Professional Research Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If pursuing a four-year BA, the final year should focus heavily on research output."},{"type":"p","text":"Build 4–6 substantial projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Economic Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Relationship Between Inflation and Household Consumption"},{"type":"p","text":"Use real datasets and statistical analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Financial Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Fundamental Analysis of an Indian Listed Company"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Profitability"},{"text":"Cash flows"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Ratios"},{"text":"Industry position"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Econometric Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Factors Affecting Youth Employment"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a regression model using an appropriate public dataset."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Market Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Payment Adoption Among Young Consumers"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct a survey and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Age"},{"text":"Income"},{"text":"Usage"},{"text":"Preferences"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Barriers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Research Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDP"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"unemployment"},{"text":"interest rates"},{"text":"exchange rates"},{"text":"market indicators"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Research Paper"},{"type":"p","text":"Write a professional 15–25 page research paper with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research question"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Methodology"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Results"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"Conclusions"},{"text":"Recommendations"},{"text":"References"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Key Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Economics + statistics"},{"text":"Economic research project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Econometrics + Python/SQL"},{"text":"Data analysis project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Research specialisation"},{"text":"Internship + specialised research"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional research"},{"text":"Dissertation + portfolio + internship"}]]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Micro, macro, applied economics"}],[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Accounting, corporate finance, markets"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Probability, hypothesis testing, regression"}],[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"OLS, time series, panel data"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced formulas, PivotTables, Power Query"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas, NumPy, statsmodels, SciPy"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Joins, CTEs, aggregation, window functions"}],[{"text":"R"},{"text":"Statistical/econometric research"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Research dashboards"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Literature review, methodology, data collection"}],[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Research reports, briefs, executive summaries"}],[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"PowerPoint, data storytelling"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Cleaning, validation, visualisation"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Research assistance, data analysis, literature synthesis"}]]}]},{"heading":"Research Tools to Learn","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Data sources"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable working with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government statistical datasets"},{"text":"Central-bank publications"},{"text":"World Bank datasets"},{"text":"IMF datasets"},{"text":"UN datasets"},{"text":"OECD datasets"},{"text":"Financial-market datasets"},{"text":"Company annual reports"},{"text":"Industry reports"},{"text":"Academic papers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"table","header":["Tool","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"R"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Stata"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"EViews"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For economics-focused research, Stata, R and Python can be particularly useful."}]},{"heading":"Research Methodology Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional Research Associate should understand the complete research cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research question","Literature review","Hypothesis","Research design","Data collection","Data cleaning","Statistical/econometric analysis","Interpretation","Validation/robustness checks","Report writing","Presentation","Recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"This workflow is more important than simply knowing individual software packages."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are extremely valuable for this career."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economic research institutions"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Research universities"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Consulting companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investment research firms"},{"text":"Asset managers"},{"text":"Brokerage/research firms"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Credit-rating organisations"},{"text":"FinTech companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public-policy think tanks"},{"text":"Development organisations"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Government research programmes"},{"text":"International development organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Market research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market research firms"},{"text":"Consulting companies"},{"text":"Consumer companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Data/analytics companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Economic Research Intern"},{"text":"Financial Research Intern"},{"text":"Equity Research Intern"},{"text":"Policy Research Intern"},{"text":"Market Research Intern"},{"text":"Data Research Intern"},{"text":"Research Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Investment Research Intern"},{"text":"Economic Analyst Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should support the career rather than replace actual research experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Economics/research"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Python for economics"},{"text":"R for statistics"},{"text":"Stata"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance track"},{"type":"p","text":"Potentially useful:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CFA pathway"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Investment research"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data track"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Machine learning fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Always verify current certification structures, eligibility and exam requirements before enrolling."}]},{"heading":"Jobs After BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry possibilities"},{"type":"table","header":["Job","Alignment"],"rows":[[{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Junior Research Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Research Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Economic Research Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Economic Research Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Financial Research Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Market Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Policy Research Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Investment Research Assistant"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Business Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Industry Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Credit Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Research & Consulting Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact job title depends heavily on the employer."}]},{"heading":"Financial Research Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the student wants to move toward investment research:"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Income Statement","Balance Sheet","Cash Flow Statement"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Analysis","Revenue growth","Margins","ROE/ROCE","Debt","Cash flows"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Valuation","DCF","P/E","EV/EBITDA","P/B","Comparable companies"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Industry analysis","Company analysis","Management analysis","Competitive advantage","Risks","Investment thesis"]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 5–10 company research reports."},{"type":"p","text":"Each should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business overview"},{"text":"Industry analysis"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Growth drivers"},{"text":"Risks"},{"text":"Competitive position"},{"text":"Investment thesis"}]}]},{"heading":"Economic Research Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an economist/research path:"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Development economics"},{"text":"Labour economics"},{"text":"Monetary economics"},{"text":"Fiscal policy"},{"text":"International economics"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio examples"},{"type":"h","text":"Inflation forecasting model"},{"type":"h","text":"Unemployment analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"GDP growth analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Interest-rate transmission study"},{"type":"h","text":"Youth employment study"},{"type":"h","text":"Rural income analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Policy impact evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"For serious economist roles, a master's degree in Economics/Econometrics or a related quantitative field is usually a strong next step."}]},{"heading":"Policy Research Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student can transition into:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Associate","Policy Researcher","Policy Analyst","Senior Policy Analyst","Policy Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy evaluation"},{"text":"Cost-benefit analysis"},{"text":"Public finance"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Programme evaluation"},{"text":"Stakeholder research"},{"text":"Policy writing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio project would be:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Evaluation of a Public Programme Using Outcome Indicators and Available Data.”"}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is highly valuable for this career."},{"type":"h","text":"Best options"},{"type":"table","header":["PG Degree","Best Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Economics"},{"text":"Economic research"}],[{"text":"MSc Economics"},{"text":"Quantitative economics"}],[{"text":"MSc Econometrics"},{"text":"Advanced research"}],[{"text":"MSc Financial Economics"},{"text":"Finance/economics"}],[{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"Financial research"}],[{"text":"MSc Statistics"},{"text":"Quantitative research"}],[{"text":"MSc Data Science"},{"text":"Data-intensive research"}],[{"text":"MA Applied Economics"},{"text":"Applied economic research"}],[{"text":"MA Public Policy"},{"text":"Policy research"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"Corporate/financial research"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Research + analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"Finance/accounting research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Particularly strong combinations"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Applied Economics","MA/MSc Economics","Research Associate","Economist"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Financial Economics","MSc Financial Economics","Financial Research Analyst"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Applied Economics","MSc Econometrics","Quantitative Research"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Applied Economics","MA Public Policy","Policy Research Associate"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Financial Economics","MSc Finance/MBA Finance","Investment Research"]}]},{"heading":"Academic Research Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the long-term objective is university/research-institute research:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","MA/MSc Economics","Research Assistant/Project Associate","MPhil/PhD or equivalent research pathway depending on current academic rules","Researcher/Faculty/Economist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For academic research, build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Publications"},{"text":"Conference papers"},{"text":"Research assistantships"},{"text":"Econometric skills"},{"text":"Strong quantitative methods"},{"text":"Academic writing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA alone is generally not the endpoint for an academic economist/researcher career."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Applied and financial economics are strong international postgraduate areas."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful master's fields"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Applied Economics"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Financial Economics"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Quantitative Economics"},{"text":"Economic Policy"},{"text":"Development Economics"},{"text":"Behavioural Economics"},{"text":"Financial Data Science"},{"text":"Computational Economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong international specialisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Financial economics"},{"text":"Behavioural economics"},{"text":"Development economics"},{"text":"Computational economics"},{"text":"Climate economics"},{"text":"Health economics"},{"text":"Labour economics"},{"text":"Financial data analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international roles, quantitative skills, internships, research experience and postgraduate study are often more important than the BA title alone."}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly change research workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search","Read","Extract","Analyse","Write","Present"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Large-scale document retrieval","AI-assisted literature mapping","Information extraction","Data cleaning assistance","Statistical analysis","Model comparison","Research synthesis","Human verification","Final research output"]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to use AI for"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature discovery"},{"text":"Document comparison"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Coding assistance"},{"text":"Statistical explanation"},{"text":"Report structuring"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Research summarisation"},{"text":"Research question generation"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But AI-generated evidence must always be independently verified. A research professional is responsible for methodology, source quality, statistical validity and conclusions."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Research Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["The combination of economics","data","AI can open newer roles:"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economic Data Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Data Analyst"},{"text":"Quantitative Research Assistant"},{"text":"AI Economics Research Associate"},{"text":"Policy Data Analyst"},{"text":"Economic Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Market Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Research Analyst"},{"text":"ESG Research Analyst"},{"text":"Climate Economics Research Analyst"},{"text":"FinTech Research Analyst"},{"text":"Economic Forecasting Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Research Analyst"},{"text":"AI Policy Research Associate"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The degree does not restrict the student to research."},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economist"},{"text":"Economic Analyst"},{"text":"Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Economic Consultant"},{"text":"Development Economist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Analyst"},{"text":"Equity Research Analyst"},{"text":"Credit Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"FP&A Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Research Data Analyst"},{"text":"BI Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consulting Analyst"},{"text":"Strategy Analyst"},{"text":"Business Research Analyst"},{"text":"Market Intelligence Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy Researcher"},{"text":"Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Public Affairs Analyst"},{"text":"Development Programme Analyst"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"General research pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Intern","Research Assistant","Research Associate","Senior Research Associate","Research Analyst / Research Lead","Senior Researcher / Economist","Research Director / Head of Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial research pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Intern","Research Associate","Financial Research Analyst","Senior Research Analyst","Research Lead","Head of Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Economics pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","Economic Research Associate","Economic Analyst","Economist","Senior Economist","Chief Economist / Research Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced economist positions generally benefit substantially from postgraduate quantitative training."}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to demonstrate:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I can formulate a research question, find and validate data, clean and analyse it statistically, apply appropriate economic/financial methods, interpret the results and communicate evidence clearly through reports, dashboards and presentations.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Target profile"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"BA Applied/Financial Economics"}],[{"text":"Research projects"},{"text":"4–6"}],[{"text":"Internships"},{"text":"2–3"}],[{"text":"Research reports"},{"text":"3+"}],[{"text":"Policy/industry reports"},{"text":"2+"}],[{"text":"Company research reports"},{"text":"5+ if pursuing finance"}],[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Python + SQL"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Intermediate/strong"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Working proficiency"}],[{"text":"Research writing"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Basic working knowledge"}],[{"text":"PG"},{"text":"Strongly recommended for specialist research"}]]}]},{"heading":"Best Practical Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Applied Economics / Financial Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Build micro + macro + statistics + accounting + finance fundamentals","Master Excel + Python + SQL + Power BI","Learn econometrics and research methodology","Choose Economic Research / Financial Research / Policy Research / Market Research","Complete 2–3 relevant internships","Build 4–6 serious research projects","Publish/write research reports and policy/industry briefs","Apply for Research Assistant / Junior Research Associate / Research Analyst / Economic Research Associate","Gain 2–3 years of research experience","Pursue MA/MSc Economics, Econometrics, Financial Economics, Finance, Statistics, Data Science or Public Policy depending on specialisation","Progress to Senior Research Associate → Research Analyst/Lead → Economist/Research Lead → Research Director/Head of Research."]},{"type":"h","text":"Best 2030-ready combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Economics","Econometrics","Financial/Policy Research","Python","SQL","Advanced Excel","Power BI","Research Writing","AI-assisted Research","Strong Portfolio","Internship Experience."],"sep":"+"}]}]}